**Method:** pcap-based, per Global Constraints — not client wall clock.

- [ ] **Step 1: Capture a GET loop against all 17 OIDs while tcpdumping**

On the host, start a capture (adjust interface name as needed for this DUT's link):

```bash
tcpdump -i <iface> -w ~/pcap/phase2-mxportdb-$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M).pcapng \
